  "description": "Determine if an array of size n can be constructed from an array of all 1s by replacing an element with the sum of all elements.",
  "target": [
    9,
    3,
    5
  ],
  "pseudocode": "1. maxHeap = push all elements from target\n2. totalSum = sum(target)\n3. while maxHeap.top() > 1:\n4.   maxVal = maxHeap.pop()\n5.   restSum = totalSum - maxVal\n6.   if restSum == 1: return true\n7.   prevVal = maxVal % restSum\n8.   if prevVal == 0 or prevVal == maxVal: return false\n9.   maxHeap.push(prevVal)\n10.  totalSum = restSum + prevVal\n11. return true",
